# /bug from a test bot. Without TTL_GITHUB_TOKEN the report is saved to ttl-reports/ on the server.
# Expect the log line "[ttl] bug report from TtlBotBug: test report from the bot suite".
ttlbot spawn TtlBotBug
@sleep 2
execute as TtlBotBug run bug test report from the bot suite
@sleep 1
ttlbot remove TtlBotBug
